  "note": "Election of the Limavady Urban District Council, polled Wednesday 18 May 1949; a contest for nine seats (Londonderry Sentinel, 19 May 1949, p. 5). Twelve nominations were reported on 5 May for the nine seats; the printed result lists eleven candidates, Henry Bloomfield not appearing, so one nomination must have been withdrawn before the poll. Nine elected and two defeated are all printed with votes. No party label was printed."
